Fee row re-measured: 46px (y737–783) against 30/30/32/32/32 siblings; label single-line x1542–1695, value single-line x1747–1906. The §4 wrap prediction stays refuted, and change (b) is inert here too — identical 46px. Change (a) renders no gutter, correctly.

